+# Phase 01 Plan 01: Postgres Foundation (Supabase + pgvector) Summary
+
+**Merged postgres-sql-changeover branch (2308 lines) into zbrain, reconfigured PostgresDB for Supabase session pooler with SSL, and extended schema with pgvector extension + HNSW/GIN indexes for semantic search**
+
+## Performance
+
+- **Duration:** ~30 min
+- **Started:** 2026-03-04T17:30:00Z
+- **Completed:** 2026-03-04T18:02:21Z (checkpoint reached — awaiting Supabase deployment verification)
+- **Tasks completed:** 2 of 3 (Task 3 is human-verify checkpoint)
+- **Files modified:** 25+
+
+## Accomplishments
+- Merged `origin/postgres-sql-changeover` cleanly into `zbrain` (2308 insertions, no conflicts)
+- PostgresDB singleton now supports `DATABASE_URL` as primary connection method (Supabase session pooler, required on Windows)
+- Added `sslmode=require` to all connection paths for Supabase cloud security
+- Extended schema with pgvector extension (`CREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS vector`)
+- Added `content_embeddings` and `property_embeddings` tables with `vector(768)` columns
+- Added HNSW indexes for approximate nearest neighbor search (cosine similarity)
+- Added GIN indexes on metadata JSONB columns for hybrid keyword+vector search
+- Added B-tree indexes on `page_id`, `workspace`, `property_name` for common query patterns
+
+## Task Commits
+
+Each task was committed atomically:
+
+1. **Task 1: Merge postgres-sql-changeover and reconfigure for Supabase** - `cbad997` (merge) + `c10db76` (feat)
+2. **Task 2: Extend schema with pgvector, HNSW indexes, GIN indexes** - `118534c` (feat)
+3. **Task 3: Checkpoint — awaiting Supabase deployment verification** - pending user action
+
+## Files Created/Modified
+- `promaia/storage/postgres_db.py` - PostgresDB singleton with Supabase session pooler + SSL support
+- `promaia/storage/schema.sql` - Full 660-line schema with pgvector, embedding tables, HNSW+GIN indexes
+- `promaia/storage/db_init.py` - Database initialization script for schema deployment
+- `docs/env.template` - Updated with Supabase session pooler connection vars (DATABASE_URL + individual fallbacks)
+- 20+ storage/agent/mail/AI modules updated to use PostgresDB instead of SQLite
+
+## Decisions Made
+- `DATABASE_URL` as primary connection method — session pooler is required on Windows due to IPv6 routing issues with direct Supabase connections
+- `sslmode=require` added for all cloud connections — Supabase requires SSL
+- `vector(768)` not `halfvec` — matches gemini-embedding-001 output dimensions per Gemini architectural review
+- `vector_cosine_ops` for HNSW — matches former ChromaDB `hnsw:space=cosine` configuration for consistent similarity scores
+- Session pooler URL format: `postgresql://postgres.PROJECT_REF:PASSWORD@aws-0-REGION.pooler.supabase.com:5432/postgres`
+
